## Conducting polymer-functionalized mesoporous metal-organic frameworks for high-performance Li-S battery
Xiao-Fei Liu<sup>1</sup>, Ya-Rui Wang<sup>1</sup>, Hong Chen<sup>1</sup>, Bo Li<sup>2</sup>, and Shuang Quan Zang<sup>1</sup>
